12. Adding your .com later: buy the domain, add it in Vercel, update Supabase site URL and site.config.ts.
13. Modify and migrate: where to change the look, add a page, add a service, swap the database, swap email or booking, change hosting.
14. Free-tier limits and backups: what to watch (database size, bandwidth, email count, inactive projects pausing), and how to export a backup.
15. Troubleshooting: the ten most likely problems and fixes.
